cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its derived result tables, please cite this repository and the associated article."
title: "Microbiome Hierarchical Factors and Neuropsychiatric Disease"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility code, final derived summary tables, supplementary workbooks,
  and figure source data for analyses of host genetic organization across 241
  gut microbial species in the Swedish and HUNT cohorts, including global GFA,
  cross-cohort comparison, phylogenetic organization, cell-regulatory analyses,
  disease S-LDSC, and targeted regional and molecular-QTL follow-up.
keywords:
  - microbiome GWAS
  - genetic factor analysis
  - cross-cohort validation
  - stratified LD score regression
  - molecular QTL
authors:
  - family-names: Shen
    given-names: Jing
repository-code: "https://github.com/duanxian0301/Microbiome_Hierarchical_Factors_NDD"
